<title>TURKEY: Turkish police killed in suicide attack.</title>
<headline>Turkish police killed in suicide attack.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Turkish policemen died and four were injured in a suicide bomb attack by an unidentified woman on a riot police headquarters in the southern town of Adana on Friday, the state-run Anatolian news agency said.</p>
<p>The woman attacker was blown to pieces in the explosion, Anatolian said. It gave no further details.</p>
